ant was  force prices up in other parts of the  world so that Americans won't think  they're getting screwed anymore because  the prices will be really high  everywhere I I genuinely don't know but  that appears to be his idea this guy  said that wages are too high in America  and steel still he got elected you know  this isn't really a surprise now not not  a surprise at all and shocking the con  man isn't really going to lower drug  prices here in the United States
 

